Viktor 10.10.2026: «♂ и ♀ сделай как svg — текстовые снова дают проблему со сдвигом».

The Trainer said male and female with the text signs ♂ ♀, whose glyphs sit off the line in the page's fonts (the Creator's buttons have been Lucide's mars and venus since 1281). The voice's chips are those drawings now (named for the ear, with a tip each), the measured voice beside each folder and each set made from it begins with its drawing, and a toast says the word (male, female).

Suite: 566/0 in the kitchen (the chips and the rows drawn, the icon centred in its chip within 1.5 px, no ♂ ♀ text left in the room; the older voice check reads the text without the sign).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tools/console/app.css         |  4 ++++
 tools/console/heresy-train.js | 21 ++++++++++++++-------
 2 files changed, 18 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tools/console/app.css b/tools/console/app.css
index 38613ba..24c0cb5 100644
--- a/tools/console/app.css
+++ b/tools/console/app.css
@@ -4587,6 +4587,10 @@ body[data-frame] :is(#view-compose, #view-take) { scrollbar-gutter: stable; }
 .tr-voice-opts { display: inline-flex; gap: 4px; }
 .tr-voice .tr-chip { padding: 2px 9px; }
 .tr-voice .tr-chip.is-on { border-color: var(--amber); color: var(--amber); }
+/* HERESY 1314: male and female drawn, on the line with their words */
+.tr-voice .tr-chip-sex { display: inline-grid; place-items: center; padding: 2px 8px; }
+.tr-voice .tr-chip-sex .ui-ico { width: 15px; height: 15px; }
+.ui-ico.tr-sex { display: inline-block; width: 13px; height: 13px; margin-right: 3px; vertical-align: -2px; }
 /* HERESY 1169 (Viktor 08.10.2026: «как в кодовом редакторе отображение номера строки… по Alt+K маркировать строки, а по Alt+J
    прыгать на них. И подсвечивать тонким альфа слоем все музыкальные теги»): the lines' numbers in the box's left padding, a
    marked line's number amber with a dot and a faint band along the line; the [tags] under a thin amber layer */
diff --git a/tools/console/heresy-train.js b/tools/console/heresy-train.js
index 6224703..33e2e0e 100644
--- a/tools/console/heresy-train.js
+++ b/tools/console/heresy-train.js
@@ -546,7 +546,7 @@
